00:32:31.020 --> 00:33:08.540
use and he is one of the great great furniture men of all time the great finishers this was all white a month ago and roger's men took all the paint off and now this genius named laszlo sally has made this magnificent staircase for me i am why do i feel like you're selling me a banister well is it beautiful is it i mean would you like to slide down it how about it sarah how about a I think he formed the hyperbole habit by saying things like, John James Audubon is simply the finest bird painter who ever lived.
